        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Aramaic</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 900 BCE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Family</span><span class="info-stat-val">Afroasiatic: the Northwest Semitic branch, close to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hebrew">Hebrew</a> and Phoenician</span></div>
